WEBVTT

00:01.009 --> 00:03.905
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:03.974 --> 00:11.112
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:11.802 --> 00:14.491
Oh, we had some good times, Trashy.
哦，我们度过了一些美好时光，Trashy。

00:14.560 --> 00:15.905
But you're gonna love the dump.
但你一定会喜欢这个垃圾场的。

00:15.974 --> 00:18.940
You'll make
so many trashy new friends.
你会让
这么多垃圾新朋友。

00:19.009 --> 00:20.216
Ooh.
哦。

00:20.285 --> 00:21.664
[laughs]
[笑]

00:24.423 --> 00:26.423
[grunts]
[咕哝]

00:26.491 --> 00:27.836
I'm gonna miss you.
我会想念你的。

00:27.905 --> 00:28.905
Huh?
啊？

00:28.940 --> 00:30.147
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

00:30.216 --> 00:31.733
Hi, Mrs. Puff!
嗨，泡芙女士！

00:31.802 --> 00:32.560
Ah!
啊!

00:32.629 --> 00:34.629
I'm not here!
我不在！

00:34.698 --> 00:36.974
Oops, my mistake.
哎呀，我的错误。

00:37.043 --> 00:38.181
Hi, Plankton!
嗨，浮游生物！

00:38.250 --> 00:39.388
Hi, Bubble Bass!
嗨，泡泡巴斯！

00:39.457 --> 00:41.423
Hi, Mr. Mailman!
嗨，邮递员先生！

00:41.491 --> 00:43.216
[together] We're not here.
[在一起]我们不在这里。

00:43.285 --> 00:46.940
Huh, maybe I need glasses.
呃，也许我需要戴眼镜。

00:47.009 --> 00:48.250
[hums]
[哼哼]

00:48.319 --> 00:50.940
[knocking]
[敲门声]

00:55.698 --> 00:57.802
Fellow sponge sufferers,
海绵宝宝们，

00:57.871 --> 01:02.147
the 431st We Hate SpongeBob Club
第431届我们讨厌海绵宝宝俱乐部

01:02.216 --> 01:03.974
will now come to order.
现在将来订购。

01:04.043 --> 01:05.767
And now our motto...
现在我们的座右铭...

01:05.836 --> 01:09.112
all: We don't mean SpongeBob
any harm.
全部：我们不是指海绵宝宝
任何伤害。

01:09.181 --> 01:12.043
We just can't stand him.
我们就是受不了他。

01:12.112 --> 01:15.423
Does anyone have any
new sponge-pain
有谁有吗
新海绵疼痛

01:15.491 --> 01:17.043
they would like to share?
他们愿意分享吗？

01:17.112 --> 01:18.974
- How much time do you have?
- I do!
- 你有多少时间？
- 我愿意！

01:19.043 --> 01:20.536
- Oh, yes, I do.
- I have to unwrap my package
- 哦，是的，我愿意。
- 我必须打开我的包裹

01:20.560 --> 01:21.491
of pain.
- [laughing]
的痛苦。
- [笑]

01:21.560 --> 01:23.526
Huh?
Hold that agony.
啊？
忍住那种痛苦吧。

01:23.595 --> 01:25.802
Hello, Squidward!
你好，章鱼哥！

01:25.871 --> 01:27.009
Proceed.
继续。

01:27.078 --> 01:31.009
Ahem, I have some misfortune
to share.
咳咳，我有些不幸
分享。

01:31.078 --> 01:33.974
The chair recognizes
sufferer Puff.
主席认识到
受苦者泡芙。

01:34.043 --> 01:38.078
Please receive
the Speaking Sponge.
请接收
会说话的海绵

01:38.147 --> 01:40.802
It all began last week.
both: ♪ La-la-la ♪
这一切都始于上周。
两者：♪ 啦啦啦 ♪

01:40.871 --> 01:44.181
<i>I was enjoying one
of my favorite things,</i>
<i>我很享受其中一个
我最喜欢的东西，</i>

01:44.250 --> 01:47.629
<i>awarding a student
their driver's license.</i>
<i>奖励学生
他们的驾驶执照。</i>

01:47.698 --> 01:50.181
You've passed
your driver's exam, Bertie.
你已经通过了
你的驾驶考试，伯蒂。

01:50.250 --> 01:52.905
- [gasps]
- Congratulations.
- [喘气]
- 恭喜。

01:52.974 --> 01:56.319
I couldn't have done it
without you, Mrs. Puff.
我做不到
没有你，普芙夫人。

01:56.388 --> 01:59.147
[laughs]
I bet you can teach anyone.
[笑]
我打赌你可以教任何人。

01:59.216 --> 02:00.491
[laughs]
Oh.
[笑]
哦。

02:00.560 --> 02:03.078
Hmm?
- [cackling]
唔？
- [咯咯笑]

02:03.147 --> 02:05.250
Almost anyone.
几乎任何人。

02:05.319 --> 02:06.940
- Nice license.
- [whimpers]
- 好的许可证。
- [呜咽]

02:07.009 --> 02:08.767
Can I touch it?
我可以摸一下吗？

02:08.836 --> 02:11.147
[laughs]
- Ew, gross!
[笑]
- 呃，恶心！

02:11.216 --> 02:12.802
[straining]
[紧张]

02:12.871 --> 02:14.043
Ow!
[loud crash]
噢！
[巨响]

02:14.112 --> 02:16.491
Well,
looks like you have an opening
嗯，
看起来你有空缺

02:16.560 --> 02:19.354
in your schedule, Mrs. Puff.
在你的日程安排中，帕芙女士。

02:19.423 --> 02:20.940
<i>I tried to leave,</i>
<i>我试图离开，</i>

02:21.009 --> 02:24.457
<i>but we all know
there is no escape from...</i>
<i>但我们都知道
无法逃脱……</i>

02:24.526 --> 02:26.043
<i>[whimpers]</i>
<i>[呜咽]</i>

02:26.112 --> 02:29.388
<i>SpongeBob.</i>
<i>海绵宝宝。</i>

02:29.457 --> 02:32.388
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

02:32.457 --> 02:33.905
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

02:33.974 --> 02:36.078
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

02:36.147 --> 02:37.285
Ah! Ooh.
啊!哦。

02:37.354 --> 02:39.388
Accelerate safely into traffic.
加速安全进入交通。

02:39.457 --> 02:42.354
[engine roars]
[发动机轰鸣声]

02:42.423 --> 02:45.560
Now for a 360-point turn!
现在来个 360 度大转弯！

02:45.629 --> 02:47.009
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

02:47.078 --> 02:48.078
Ahh!
啊！

02:48.112 --> 02:49.043
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

02:49.112 --> 02:51.871
Oops. Almost ran a stop sign.
哎呀。差点就跑到停车标志了。

02:51.940 --> 02:53.285
Whoa!
哇！

02:53.354 --> 02:54.940
Ohh-ohh-ohh!
哦哦哦！

02:55.009 --> 02:57.078
Ahh!
啊！

02:57.147 --> 02:58.560
Oof.
钱币。

02:58.629 --> 03:02.526
SpongeBob destroyed
my beautiful school.
海绵宝宝被摧毁
我美丽的学校。

03:02.595 --> 03:05.112
Just like last week!
就像上周一样！

03:05.181 --> 03:06.526
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

03:06.595 --> 03:07.802
It's okay.
没关系。

03:07.871 --> 03:09.836
We're here for you.
我们随时为您服务。

03:09.905 --> 03:12.354
Who would like to share next?
接下来谁愿意分享？

03:12.423 --> 03:13.698
I would.
我会的。

03:13.767 --> 03:16.526
I'd like to share a hug.
我想分享一个拥抱。

03:16.595 --> 03:19.526
Looks like you could use
a stamp!
看起来你可以使用
一张邮票！

03:19.595 --> 03:22.181
I believe that I am next
我相信我就是下一个

03:22.250 --> 03:23.802
in the roundelay.
在圆形延迟中。

03:23.871 --> 03:26.871
My speaking sponge, please.
我的会说话的海绵，请。

03:26.940 --> 03:28.216
Hmm.
唔。

03:28.285 --> 03:31.905
I was at the Krusty Krab
to grab a light snack
我在蟹堡王店
吃点小吃

03:31.974 --> 03:34.423
<i>between first and second lunch.</i>
<i>第一顿午餐和第二顿午餐之间。</i>

03:34.491 --> 03:36.905
Order up, oh, valued customer.
尊敬的顾客，赶快下单吧。

03:36.974 --> 03:41.423
Ah, finally sustenance
for my starving stomach.
啊终于有食粮了
为了我饥饿的胃。

03:41.491 --> 03:44.285
I hope it's perfect.
我希望它是完美的。

03:44.354 --> 03:45.560
Ahh...
啊...

03:45.629 --> 03:47.836
- [gasps]
- Huh?
- [喘气]
- 啊？

03:47.905 --> 03:50.698
It's not perfect!
这并不完美！

03:50.767 --> 03:52.388
It's too greasy!
太油腻了！

03:52.457 --> 03:54.181
[groans]
Hmm.
[呻吟]
嗯。

03:54.250 --> 03:58.423
And this fry
isn't greasy enough!
还有这个炒菜
还不够油腻！

03:58.491 --> 04:00.112
<i>Try as I might...</i> [coughs]
<i>尽我所能...</i>[咳嗽]

04:00.181 --> 04:03.940
<i>SpongeBob would not let me
consume a single calorie.</i>
<i>海绵宝宝不让我
消耗一卡路里。</i>

04:04.009 --> 04:07.560
<i>I tried to take a sip of soda
to slake my thirst.</i>
<i>我试着喝了一口苏打水
解渴。</i>

04:07.629 --> 04:09.078
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:09.147 --> 04:10.457
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

04:10.526 --> 04:12.423
[slurping]
[发出声音]

04:12.491 --> 04:13.733
Bleh.
布莱赫。

04:15.871 --> 04:18.078
Not fizzy enough!
不够泡啊！

04:18.147 --> 04:20.181
[growls]
[咆哮]

04:20.250 --> 04:23.526
<i>That perforated pest wouldn't
let me taste a morsel</i>
<i>那个穿孔害虫不会
让我尝一口</i>

04:23.595 --> 04:24.940
<i>of Krabby Patty.</i>
<i>蟹黄派蒂。</i>

04:25.009 --> 04:26.733
Ahh!
啊！

04:26.802 --> 04:30.181
Give me back my patty,
you festering fusspot!
把我的肉饼还给我
你这个溃烂的小题大做！

04:30.250 --> 04:31.974
[gasps]
I can't.
[喘气]
我不能。

04:32.043 --> 04:34.078
[growls]
[咆哮]

04:34.147 --> 04:37.354
[panting] The sesame seeds
are misaligned,
[喘气] 芝麻
未对准，

04:37.423 --> 04:39.733
and the lettuce
has too many wrinkles!
和生菜
皱纹太多了！

04:39.802 --> 04:42.388
The tomato has lost its sheen!
西红柿失去了光泽！

04:42.457 --> 04:47.629
Let me eat,
you insufferable interrupter!
让我吃，
你这个令人难以忍受的干扰者！

04:48.319 --> 04:51.388
Victory is mine!
胜利是我的！

04:51.457 --> 04:52.974
[gulps]
[吞咽]

04:53.043 --> 04:55.457
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

04:55.526 --> 04:56.698
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:56.767 --> 04:58.319
A-ooga!
啊啊啊！

04:58.388 --> 05:01.974
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

05:02.043 --> 05:03.319
[munching]
[咀嚼]

05:03.388 --> 05:06.871
A tad spongy, but not bad.
有点海绵状，但还不错。

05:06.940 --> 05:09.078
[stomach rumbles]
Ooh.
[肚子咕咕叫]
哦。

05:09.147 --> 05:12.354
That fry cook has given me
a slight case of...
那个炒菜厨师给了我
一个轻微的案例...

05:12.423 --> 05:15.043
[gulps]
indigestion.
[吞咽]
消化不良。

05:15.112 --> 05:17.354
[stomach rumbles]
[肚子咕咕叫]

05:17.423 --> 05:20.319
Oh.
- [grunting]
哦。
- [咕哝]

05:20.388 --> 05:24.560
I shall let no customer eat
a less-than-perfect patty.
我不会让任何顾客吃饭
不太完美的肉饼

05:24.629 --> 05:26.457
Oh.
哦。

05:26.526 --> 05:28.560
Ahh.
啊。

05:28.629 --> 05:31.491
I forgot my hat.
我忘记带帽子了。

05:31.560 --> 05:35.078
Ahh!
啊！

05:35.147 --> 05:36.491
[gulps]
[吞咽]

05:36.560 --> 05:40.595
That squishy simpleton
left my navel in knots.
那个软软的傻瓜
让我的肚脐打结。

05:40.664 --> 05:44.595
[grunting]
You call that suffering?
[咕噜声]
你管这叫苦？

05:44.664 --> 05:47.836
I'll tell you
a truly terrifying tale.
我告诉你
一个真正可怕的故事。

05:47.905 --> 05:51.423
It was a dark and spongy night.
那是一个又黑又松软的夜晚。

05:51.491 --> 05:53.940
<i>I was working peacefully
in my lab</i>
<i>我平静地工作
在我的实验室</i>

05:54.009 --> 05:58.767
<i>on my newest invention to, uh,
help fishkind?</i>
<i>关于我的最新发明，呃，
帮助鱼类？</i>

05:58.836 --> 06:00.285
<i>Yeah, that's it.</i>
<i>是的，就是这样。</i>

06:00.354 --> 06:05.664
Yes, my terrible toilet paper
will wipe Bikini Bottom
是的，我糟糕的卫生纸
会擦拭比基尼泳裤

06:05.733 --> 06:07.423
off the face of the ocean!
离开海洋！

06:07.491 --> 06:10.147
[laughs]
Plus it's quilted.
[笑]
而且它是绗缝的。

06:10.216 --> 06:11.664
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

06:11.733 --> 06:14.147
- [laughing]
- Huh?
- [笑]
- 啊？

06:16.078 --> 06:18.250
Eh.
[cackling]
呃。
[咯咯笑]

06:18.319 --> 06:19.802
[laughing]
[笑]

06:21.319 --> 06:25.078
Why does something always
ruin a good evil laugh?
为什么有些事总是
毁掉善恶的笑声？

06:25.147 --> 06:27.388
- [laughing]
- Huh?
- [笑]
- 啊？

06:27.457 --> 06:31.526
<i>But then I saw it.</i>
<i>但后来我看到了。</i>

06:31.595 --> 06:35.457
<i>A wild SpongeBob had gotten
into my lab.</i>
<i>野生海绵宝宝得到了
into my lab.</i>

06:35.526 --> 06:36.733
[cawing]
[啼叫]

06:36.802 --> 06:38.250
Karen!
凯伦！

06:38.319 --> 06:41.078
It got in again!
又进来了！

06:41.147 --> 06:43.319
Did you leave
the window open again?
你离开了吗
窗户又打开了吗？

06:43.388 --> 06:49.009
[cawing]
[啼叫]

06:49.078 --> 06:51.078
Ah!
It's in my mainframe!
啊!
它在我的主机里！

06:51.147 --> 06:53.560
- [squawks]
- Oh, you dirty bird.
- [嘎嘎声]
-哦，你这只肮脏的鸟。

06:53.629 --> 06:55.216
Get down from there!
Git!
从那里下来！
吉特！

06:55.285 --> 06:56.595
[cawing]
[啼叫]

06:56.664 --> 06:59.767
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:01.629 --> 07:02.629
[squawks]
[嘎嘎声]

07:02.698 --> 07:03.733
Ahh!
啊！

07:03.802 --> 07:05.560
Come on, Lazybones.
加油吧，懒骨头们。

07:05.629 --> 07:07.836
Sweep it out the door.
扫出门去。

07:07.905 --> 07:09.698
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:09.767 --> 07:13.147
[babbling]
[胡说]

07:15.319 --> 07:18.698
- Whoa, whoa, whoa!
- Ahh!
- 哇，哇，哇！
- 啊！

07:18.767 --> 07:20.560
Whoa-oh-oh!
哇哦哦！

07:20.629 --> 07:21.733
Ah!
啊!

07:21.802 --> 07:23.560
[both groan]
[两人都呻吟]

07:23.629 --> 07:25.354
[laughing]
[笑]

07:25.423 --> 07:26.733
[straining]
[紧张]

07:26.802 --> 07:29.595
He's locked us out!
他把我们锁在门外了！

07:29.664 --> 07:31.733
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

07:31.802 --> 07:33.698
[thunder booming]
[雷霆轰鸣]

07:33.767 --> 07:36.595
So if you hear
that horrible sound
所以如果你听到
那可怕的声音

07:36.664 --> 07:39.423
of a SpongeBob, just run.
海绵宝宝，跑吧。

07:39.491 --> 07:40.698
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:40.767 --> 07:42.698
[muffled]
Run for your lives.
[低声]
为你的生命而奔跑。

07:42.767 --> 07:43.767
[babbling]
[all gasp]
[胡言乱语]
[全都喘气]

07:43.836 --> 07:45.940
Calm down.
冷静下来。

07:46.009 --> 07:49.560
My AC is just acting up again.
我的空调又开始工作了。

07:49.629 --> 07:52.181
- Whew.
- Thank Neptune.
- 呼。
- 感谢海王星。

07:52.250 --> 07:54.836
You think you all have it bad?
你以为你们都过得不好吗？

07:54.905 --> 07:58.733
Wait until you hear my tale
of spongy terror
等你听我的故事
海绵状的恐怖

07:58.802 --> 08:00.905
in real time.
实时。

08:00.974 --> 08:03.698
Three, two, one.
三、二、一。

08:03.767 --> 08:04.767
[doorbell rings]
Hmm.
[门铃响]
嗯。

08:04.802 --> 08:07.388
He had arrived.
他已经到了。

08:07.457 --> 08:08.802
<i>[eerie music]</i>
<i>[怪异音乐]</i>

08:08.871 --> 08:10.078
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

08:10.147 --> 08:12.043
But there was no one there.
但那里没有人。

08:12.112 --> 08:14.733
Perhaps it was nothing.
也许这没什么。

08:14.802 --> 08:19.526
Or was SpongeBob already
in the house?
或者海绵宝宝已经
在房子里？

08:19.595 --> 08:20.974
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:21.043 --> 08:23.147
Could I borrow a cup
of saltwater?
可以借个杯子吗
盐水？

08:23.216 --> 08:25.457
[sighs]
[叹气]

08:25.526 --> 08:26.664
Here.
这里。

08:26.733 --> 08:29.664
Of course, the saltwater
was just a ruse
当然，盐水
只是一个诡计

08:29.733 --> 08:33.147
to come inside uninvited.
不请自来地进来。

08:33.216 --> 08:34.423
Ooh.
[all gasp]
哦。
[全都喘气]

08:34.491 --> 08:35.940
Are you having a party?
你要开派对吗？

08:36.009 --> 08:38.698
Naturally,
SpongeBob lost no time
自然地，
海绵宝宝不失时机

08:38.767 --> 08:41.354
annoying everyone in the room.
惹恼了房间里的每个人。

08:41.423 --> 08:42.526
Hi, Mrs. Puff.
嗨，普芙女士。

08:42.595 --> 08:45.319
I can't wait until
my next lesson.
我等不及了
我的下一课。

08:45.388 --> 08:47.078
Eww.
呃。

08:47.147 --> 08:49.009
Mailman, I gotta tell ya,
邮递员，我得告诉你，

08:49.078 --> 08:52.009
every package from you
is a special delivery.
你的每一个包裹
是特殊快递。

08:52.078 --> 08:53.491
Let's catch up soon, huh?
我们快点追上吧？

08:53.560 --> 08:56.112
- [groans]
- Looking fit, Bubble Bass.
- [呻吟]
- 看起来很健康，泡泡巴斯。

08:56.181 --> 08:59.457
Been pumping the iron, huh?
一直在打铁吧？

08:59.526 --> 09:02.250
And, Plankton,
has anyone ever told you
还有，浮游生物，
有没有人告诉过你

09:02.319 --> 09:04.285
that you have the loveliest eye?
你有最可爱的眼睛吗？

09:04.354 --> 09:07.354
Of course,
if SpongeBob was around,
当然，
如果海绵宝宝在身边

09:07.423 --> 09:13.423
his pointy pink pal
couldn't be far behind.
他尖尖的粉红色朋友
也不甘落后。

09:13.491 --> 09:14.491
Ah.
啊。

09:14.560 --> 09:15.698
You're out of punch.
你没力气了。

09:15.767 --> 09:17.078
[growls]
[咆哮]

09:17.147 --> 09:19.009
Don't worry, Squidward.
I'll mix up a batch
别担心，章鱼哥。
我会混合一批

09:19.078 --> 09:20.698
of my special pineapple punch.
我特制的菠萝潘趣酒。

09:20.767 --> 09:22.491
[growls]
[咆哮]

09:22.560 --> 09:23.974
It's homemade.
这是自制的。

09:24.043 --> 09:26.871
Made out of the walls
of my home.
由墙壁制成
我家的。

09:26.940 --> 09:28.767
[laughs]
[笑]

09:28.836 --> 09:32.319
Oof!
钱币！

09:32.388 --> 09:35.354
And no SpongeBob story
would be complete
也没有海绵宝宝的故事
将会完成

09:35.423 --> 09:38.009
without him destroying something.
没有他破坏什么东西。

09:38.078 --> 09:39.802
I've got pineapple punch!
我有菠萝宾治！

09:39.871 --> 09:41.595
Whoa!
哇！

09:41.664 --> 09:45.905
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

09:45.974 --> 09:48.698
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:48.767 --> 09:52.871
Oops.
哎呀。

09:55.354 --> 09:57.698
The end.
结束。

09:57.767 --> 10:00.560
[siren wailing]
[警笛哀号]

10:00.629 --> 10:03.802
Where are we gonna finish
our club meeting now?
我们要在哪里结束
我们的俱乐部现在开会吗？

10:03.871 --> 10:05.181
Ahem.
咳咳。

10:05.250 --> 10:09.836
I know a place
you could have your meeting.
我知道一个地方
你可以开会了。

10:09.905 --> 10:12.905
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

10:12.974 --> 10:15.009
Who's ready for hors d'oeuvres?
谁准备好开胃小菜了？

10:15.078 --> 10:16.216
Watch out for the...
留意...

10:16.285 --> 10:18.698
[gulps]
[吞咽]

10:18.767 --> 10:20.423
- Toothpicks.
- Phooey.
- 牙签。
- 噗。

10:20.491 --> 10:23.009
We're all out
of speaking sponges.
我们都出去了
会说话的海绵。

10:23.078 --> 10:24.974
Oh, no, you're not.
哦，不，你不是。

10:25.043 --> 10:26.698
There's one left.
还剩一张了

10:29.974 --> 10:30.974
[babbling]
[胡说]

10:31.043 --> 10:32.767
And I was...
[coughs]
而我当时...
[咳嗽]

10:32.836 --> 10:34.940
Coughing up his mail for weeks.
他的邮件被咳了好几个星期。

10:35.009 --> 10:36.802
[coughs]
[咳嗽]

10:36.871 --> 10:39.767
<i>[breezy upbeat music]</i>
<i>[轻快欢快的音乐]</i>

10:39.836 --> 10:41.250
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:41.319 --> 10:43.319
I declare this meeting
我宣布这次会议

10:43.388 --> 10:47.733
of the We Hate SpongeBob Club adjourned.
我们讨厌海绵宝宝俱乐部休会了。

10:47.802 --> 10:48.836
Bang.
砰。

10:48.905 --> 10:51.181
[groans]
[呻吟]

[呻吟]